 "8b6de3bc-1ecb-e718-eccb-25becaf1b9e1": "“When life throws you a curve ball, it takes resilience, determination, and hope to continue walking by faith and not by sight. In her book Hiding Hope, Linni Weishaar shares her personal story—and her faith in the sure promises of God—in the face of deep challenges, loss, and God-given miracles. With candidness and transparency, she takes you on a journey to walk closer to Jesus through every twist and turn on life’s path.” ★★★★★ -Dr. Ché Ahn, Senior Pastor at Harvest Rock Church, Pasadena, CA, President at Harvest International Ministry, International Chancellor at Wagner University --- If you have grieved the loss of a baby, you are not alone. Linni's deepest desire was to one day be a mama. She had spent years dreaming of what it would be like to hold her baby—only for multiple miscarriages and an infertility diagnosis to come crashing down on her faith. What followed would test Linni’s courage to confront painful emotions while wrestling with unanswered questions about who God really was for her. She seemed alone, misunderstood by the church, and unseen by her husband. In the midst of pain and uncertainty, could she hold onto hope that Jesus would heal her body, mind, and spirit when circumstances were screaming the opposite of God’s promises? - 364 pages - 12,7 cm x 2,31 cm x 20,32 cm - Christian book, Hiding Hope, Inspirational book, Faith journey",
 "d9e9038b-9af6-21f0-346f-884357ada6fc": "This workbook is a 10 page study tool to the short, free teaching on https://youtu.be/6Oa136olblM?si=s2JB2NaZiohv8LXF on His Kingdom Ministry's YouTube Channel. By purchasing this workbook you will get a link to download the PDF so you can get more out of the teaching on healing. What’s included? Video summary and key teachings Bible passage study guide with Scripture references 12 comprehension questions Multiple-choice and true-or-false exercises Personal reflection and prayer activities Answer key and final review checklist The workbook also includes reflection space and a note clarifying that spiritual support does not replace professional medical or mental-health care. Enjoy your Bible study! May this workbook help you reflect on the message, explore the Scriptures, and deepen your understanding.",
 "258f2491-aa31-663f-1733-4b347bac99dd": "Pink Christian Prayer and Gratitude Journal: * PDF 32 pages * Ready for download upon purchase Deepen your quiet time and build an unwavering prayer routine. Whether you’re starting fresh in your spiritual walk or looking to refresh your morning devotionals, this journal is your companion for sitting at His feet. When life feels overwhelming, it’s easy to let anxiety take the driver's seat. This guided prayer journal is created to help you slow down, cast your cares, and stay rooted in God’s Word every single day. Thoughtfully designed with soft, feminine, elegant, blush-toned aesthetics and uplifting KJV Scripture prompts, this journal moves beyond blank pages to guide you step-by-step through praise, petition, and spiritual reflection. Inside You’ll Find: Daily & Monthly Habit Trackers: Stay consistent with morning prayer, evening prayer, Bible reading, and scripture memory. The S.O.A.P. Study Method: Simple, powerful framework (Scripture, Observation, Application, Prayer) to dissect the Word. \"Casting My Cares\" & \"Clean Slate\" : Release what is weighing you down and walk in grace, freedom, and renewed identity. Track Answered Prayers : Document what you asked and record how God moves over time. Intentional Intercession: Dedicated pages to pray for your family, future or current husband, church leaders, and friendships. 21-Day Fasting Tracker & Season Reviews: Set your intentions, log your days, and reflect on spiritual milestones. Structured Spiritual Habits : Prayer Habit Tracker, Bible reading checklist, Prayer points and Prayer Answers Log etc Relationship & Community Focus: Dedicated sections for marriage/future husband, family, and intercessory prayer (\"Standing In The Gap\"). Key Features to Highlight: Daily & Monthly Prayer Habit Trackers. Bible reading, and scripture memory. The S.O.A.P. Study Method. Intercession Log. 21-Day Fasting Tracker Prayer Tracker Prayer Answers Log",
 "ee499a82-e1b7-630c-1157-52e05bac99cf": "5 pages PDF ready to be downloaded upon payment. Print as many times as you like. Each page has a Christmas - Nativity scene to color and a matching Bible verse. Great coloring activity for the little ones. With Bible verses it can also be used as story telling time.",
