 "5819766b-0428-432f-8c20-9648cabf8d3d": "This heavyweight (thicker fabric) cotton t-shirt is a durable staple product with a classic/boxy fit. If you are someone who is generally pretty warm, please note that this Tshirt does have thicker fabric and is not a Tshirt suitable for workouts, but perfect for every day normal use. We have the same print on a different (thinner/softer quality) T-shirt, but that one is shipped in Europe Exclusive. This one we ship world wide. (DTG) Direct-to-garment printing: DTG printing is a process of printing direct onto textiles using specialized water-based inkjet technology. DTG printers typically have a platen designed to hold the garment in a fixed position, and the printing inks are sprayed or jetted onto the textile by the print head. It is very durable, but a bit more texture to the print than with DTF/Vinyl printing. Size S to 4XL. Generous sizes. Might shrink a little bit in the first wash. It has a relaxed style made for casual wear. Seamless double-needle collar. Double-needle sleeve and bottom hems. Taped neck and shoulders for durability. Fabrication: Solid Colors are made from 100% cotton (preshrunk jersey knit); (Heather Colors are 50% cotton, 50% polyester.) Desgined by Hilde Karin Knutsen for His Kingdom Designs, 2025 Jesus Tshirt, trosbaserte klær, kristne klær, trosklær, Praise the Lord Tshirt, King Jesus Tshirt, Christian Merch, Christian Apparel",
